// purpose: This function validates if a device is a Domain Controller. It will return true when it is a domain controller, alternatively false is returned.
// source: https://github.com/Bert-JanP/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/65d11700e1cb878403d87312acdd6b9a8dd622c1/Functions/IsDomainController.md
